  unitName: Cute Medic Daria (EU)
  unitId: 730277
  unitNumber: 7232
  description: "Daria knew ever since she was a child what she wanted to do when
    she was older: join the Siegfried Academy medical corps. Her natural clumsiness
    could have easily been an obstacle for her. For example, her friends couldn\u2019t
    count how many times she accidentally knocked over a book. However, when it came
    to taking care of a patient, she became a completely different person. Her absent-mindedness
    gave way to surprising dexterity. She was also an enthusiastic girl. She managed
    to convince a hesitant friend to accompany her to Siegfried Academy. Moreover,
    rumors say that Daria was a formidable fighter when syringes and bandages weren\u2019t
    needed. Such a promising student; what could she have to fear in the future?"
  summonDesc: "Show me where you\u2019re hurt! What? Of course I know what I\u2019m
    doing!"
  fusionDesc: "Fight? I would like to avoid it, but if it\u2019s necessary..."
